OL,3,ATrump $1 coin makes him first living
OL,4,Apresident on US currency in a century
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump's portrait has made its
OL,7,Fway on to a US coin - the latest move
OL,8,Fby the president to put his personal
OL,9,Fstamp on American institutions.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, the US Mint launched the
OL,12,F$1 (#0.74) coin with a portrait of
OL,13,FTrump alongside the words "Liberty" and
OL,14,F"In God We Trust", to celebrate
OL,15,FAmerica's 250th anniversary.
OL,17,FThe Mint said the coins, which are
OL,18,Fbeing marketed as a collectable, were
OL,19,Fnot being put into circulation for
OL,20,Fdaily use.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
